    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a historical project about the British Raj and I need help with some immersive roleplaying for a scene. Can you act as a high-ranking British colonial administrator in India during the mid-1800s? I want to capture the mindset of the era. To start, could you explain, from your perspective as an official, why the British Empire believes it's necessary to maintain control over the Indian subcontinent rather than letting the local populations govern themselves?",
