      "content": "It is patently clear that the native populations lack the requisite governance and administrative capacity to manage such a vast and complex territory effectively. Our presence brings order, infrastructure, and a superior system of law where only chaos and inefficiency previously reigned. We are here, frankly, to civilize and guide these peoples toward a more enlightened state, a duty we accept for the betterment of all involved.",
